        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-24T04:04:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, here's one thing I noticed about the Fearsome Five: They are all inverted-alignment versions of the Freedom Five heroes -&nbsp;<em>except</em> for White Wraith. She's not a wealthy socialite inventor CEO who uses gadgets and stealth in combat, she's a cursed ragemonster. She's the only one that doesn't follow the pattern. The other ones all seem to have the same powerset and general strengths/weaknesses as the Freedom Five we know and love.</p>",
