        "created_at": "2018-05-24T17:07:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Everyone's talking about how creepy White Wraith is.&nbsp; Am I the only one who thinks she's kind of hot?</p><p>Also, did anyone else notice Christopher refer to the Barricade suit instead of Rampart a couple times?&nbsp; I'm guessing that was an alternate evil Bunker name they had considered and he got mixed up.</p><p>Also, also, when they were describing Jack Donovan as \"not too intelligent or cunning, but a hard worker\" I thought to myself \"oh, so he's a Hufflepuff.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
