        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"X-metal\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/x-metal/48/4892_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> X-metal:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>rjc917 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Everyone's talking about how creepy White Wraith is.&nbsp; Am I the only one who thinks she's kind of hot?Also, did anyone else notice Christopher refer to the Barricade suit instead of Rampart a couple times?&nbsp; I'm guessing that was an alternate evil Bunker name they had considered and he got mixed up.Also, also, when they were describing Jack Donovan as \"not too intelligent or cunning, but a hard worker\" I thought to myself \"oh, so he's a Hufflepuff.\"&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nthat depends, are you also the kind of person who thinks Spite’s kind of hot?\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Nah, Spite doesn't do it for me haha.</p>",
